    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833960/extras/ce3b2a5462f2e3b6db9a4047418a3a4b.avif?t=1755071168\" width=605 height=115 /></span><br>Cute Asian Foxes wag their tails and pin their ears. They are alert and sniffing with their noses, one claps her hands and the other even bares her fangs in excitement. You go to meet them.<br><br>Easy win: Keyboard <strong>\u0421trl+D</strong> - Complete Level<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833960/extras/ab78232a53608030d3499b2b850baf47.poster.avif?t=1755071168\" width=604 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833960/extras/ab78232a53608030d3499b2b850baf47.webm?t=1755071168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833960/extras/ab78232a53608030d3499b2b850baf47.mp4?t=1755071168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the game, your goal is to collect the puzzle in order to restore the pictures. (\u25d5\u203f\u25d5)\u2661<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Live2D dynamic character<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   CG Gallery Mode<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Relaxing music<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Puzzle game</li></ul>",
